  "question": "Will AfD win the most seats in the 2026 Mecklenburg-Vorpommern parliamentary elections?",
  "conditionId": "0x6c9bd12ca2dded7eb4c688a3200e94f143cc95984eb1952ab71f7ec31e07cf8c",
